INSERT INTO changes (date, who, what, docs) VALUES
('2026-11-18', 'Onyx (General) — midnight update',
 'Facts brought current with the root site and the day''s record: Marvin now shows Version 0.1.0 where it was missing; a New in the Collection section adds Contracts 0.4.0 (paper vault; sealed files use AES-256-GCM), PodEdPro 0.4.0, Galaxy Repeat 0.4.0, Wi-Fi Tether 0.3.0, AI Teacher 0.1.0, Apple Dextop 0.1.0, Indy Travel 0.1.0 with its hotel watch, and the CashDublo App Store core 0.1.0, plus the newest newsletter edition. Design, layout, and wording style unchanged.',
 'index.html in this folder; root versions.json and CHANGES record at head b06fe636');

INSERT INTO changes (date, who, what, docs) VALUES
('2026-11-19', 'Onyx (General) — midnight update',
 'Facts brought current with the root site at head 2ab9112a and the day''s record for 2026-11-18: a New Today section adds Xnot (in build, Mac first; builds a project, signs the package with the CashDublo key, installs it on a USB-connected phone; the priority build for every seat), the Offline Password Vault 0.1.0 (passwords and keys kept offline; core built and checked; phone shell still to come), Hardware Apps (USB NFC tag transmitter design and circuit board package; gun camera design still to come), and Teaching Games (the teaching index for the Storyline Engine and Player; HACKED! in build). It also records the finished app manuals program (62 manuals) and the root Pricing and Memberships page, whose prices stand as proposed, not yet published. The newest newsletter edition is unchanged. Design, layout, and wording style unchanged.',
 'index.html in this folder; root site at head 2ab9112a8ed8; xnot README at 3d368858; offline_password_vault README at 902ca8de; daily log 2026-11-18');

INSERT INTO changes (date, who, what, docs) VALUES
('2026-11-20', 'Onyx (General) — midnight update',
 'Facts brought current with the root site at head d650d829 and the day''s record for 2026-11-19: a New Today section adds the root site''s new menu (Navigation Standard v2: a steady green header with a slide-down drawer, every stop listed once; the root only — this folder keeps its own design), Grok''s version of the site, which joined the family today in a dark, sharp style, and the day''s new apps in build: Military AI (a trained helper for armed forces around the world, every branch selectable), Onyx (the app whose chatbot will run CashDublo — the apps, the sites, and the store), AI Lawyer (trained on case logs, court records, and the law), Train AI Models (the training desk: start models, watch their stats, train across free back ends, save and resume), and the Visually Impaired AI (an assistant made for blind people). It also records Cash Grants, ordered today (grant finding for veteran-owned start-ups; looking needs no login), ten new web-app homes including HACKED! Web and Storyline Player Web, icons landed for the fourteen newest apps on the one locked template, and the course names moved to the new triple-dot form. No versions or prices are shown for the new apps; none stand in their records. Design, layout, and wording style unchanged.',
 'index.html in this folder; root site at head d650d8292037; daily log 2026-11-19');

INSERT INTO changes (date, who, what, docs) VALUES
('2026-11-21', 'Onyx (General) — midnight update',
 'Facts brought current with the root site at head 78df0b25 and the day''s record for 2026-11-20: a New Today section adds the production server fixed and live (serving the store catalogue of 34 apps, every check passing), Xnot at version 0.5.0 (sees the tools on the owner''s computer, fetches build tools it is missing, and tells the owner when it heals itself; still the priority build for every seat), Data Rebellion founded today (a local-first way to bring your own records home from the big platforms and keep them in open forms; first build ordered), and Darkweb Surfer founded today (a private browser built for the Tor network with no clearnet fallback; the fleet now stands at 136 projects). It also records the parked list — Military AI, the Onyx app, and AI Lawyer parked by the President''s word, correcting their in-build state shown here yesterday — and the build queue that now runs in their place: the Mac training app, the Offline Password Vault, Darkweb Surfer, the App Store back end, Production Emulator 0.5.0, and Storyline Studio. Closing lines record the websites in their final shape (the root holds the one working website; every seat edition now lives in the All Websites folder), the house email changed to cash.dublo@gmail.com on the site and across the apps, and the house GitHub setup live (shared issue forms, a pull request checklist, and security alerts on across the account). Design, layout, and wording style unchanged.',
 'index.html in this folder; root site at head 78df0b257a; daily log 2026-11-20');

INSERT INTO changes (date, who, what, docs) VALUES
('2026-11-22', 'Onyx (General) — midnight update',
 'Facts brought current with the root site at head 43323b2f and the day''s record for 2026-11-21: Galaxy Repeat reached version 0.5.0 (its overlay and filter now work together, verified 120 of 120 checks; the Mac build failure that day was a full disk, not the code), Xnot reached version 0.6.0 (a backup bug that could make some backups impossible to restore was fixed, and a built-in helper now explains build and signing failures through the owner''s own API connection; 54 of 54 checks pass, live proof on the owner''s Mac still owed), PodEdPro reached version 0.5.0 (Charges left counts complete recharges of both buds from confirmed sizes, with a low-level warning the owner picks at 10, 20, 30, or 40 percent and a short pop-up; 479 checks pass), Operation AI Phase One was built at version 0.1.0 (the house testing center for providers, portfolio import, key testing, screen analysis, and stock and news research; 22 of 22 checks pass), and three new projects were founded and seeded: the AI DJ Model, the Food AI Model, and the AI Calorie Tracker. Closing lines record the travel planning app settled under the name CashDublo''s Travel Planner with its fittings staged, every house module now carrying a four-part version number starting at 0.0.0.1 with the house API carrying its own, Data Rebellion still standing at its founding seed with its first build still owed, and Patent It fixed with Dear Idea''s duplicate build project removed. Design, layout, and wording style unchanged.',
 'index.html in this folder; root site at head 43323b2fe1; daily log 2026-11-21');

INSERT INTO changes (date, who, what, docs) VALUES
('2026-11-23', 'Onyx (General) — midnight update',
 'Facts brought current with the root site at head e98ccd9a and the day''s record for 2026-11-22: the fleet now stands at 146 projects, every one classified; Hair Studio 3D was founded and built at version 0.1.0 (19 of 19 checks pass, both phone bundles built in verification; its store link step is still owed before a store build); the game console family of four projects was built and landed, verified in its records, not yet proven on a device; the master site itself was corrected (Testra Accuracy back to 0.1.0, TTS Widget to 0.4.0, three wrong cards removed from the Linux page, Secure Terminal added to the Mac and Android pages, and all 34 Front Ends links land again); the build pick-list duplicate fix landed and was proven on the owner''s Mac; and in the evening 21-app Mac build run, six apps were proven on the phone (Galaxy Repeat, Go, Hit Record, IG Watch, Marvin, and Mixology), Dear Idea was fixed, and the last eight apps carry no outcome yet. Closing lines record Theme Studio ruled as theme headquarters with the themes module build still waiting on the second seat''s widened access, and that second seat''s connection seeing only 3 of the 146 projects until the owner widens it. Design, layout, and wording style unchanged.',
 'index.html in this folder; root site at head e98ccd9ae; daily log 2026-11-22');
